    excerpt: "How agents can use online business and insurance directories to generate genuine Medicare leads.",
    metaDescription: "Online business and insurance directories are an overlooked Medicare lead source — learn how agents use them to generate genuine, locally targeted leads.",
    category: "Medicare Leads",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    publishedDate: "2026-11-07",
